      "updated": 1787044651905,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hotel Booking system\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hotel Booking system\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qTn-ahkTVWSEdMMQ1XBga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1340.0641667127954,
      "y": 239.05930175717253,
      "width": 1095.6793212890625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 480017397,
      "version": 934,
      "versionNonce": 1243140309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787048476795,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n1. User should be able to Browse Hotels by location. \n2. User should be able to browse available rooms in a Hotel.\n3. User should be able to book rooms.\n\nNon functional requirements\n- Booking needs to be consistent ( No double booking) and Hotel list, and room list should focus on availability.\n- read traffic >> write traffic\n- for festivals there will be surge/spike in traffic\n- Latency < 5 sec viewing hotels and rooms. Booking will be two phase - reserve for 10 min until payment is done\n\nOut of scope\n- GDPR complaince\n- fault tolerance",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n1. User should be able to Browse Hotels by location. \n2. User should be able to browse available rooms in a Hotel.\n3. User should be able to book rooms.\n\nNon functional requirements\n- Booking needs to be consistent ( No double booking) and Hotel list, and room list should focus on availability.\n- read traffic >> write traffic\n- for festivals there will be surge/spike in traffic\n- Latency < 5 sec viewing hotels and rooms. Booking will be two phase - reserve for 10 min until payment is done\n\nOut of scope\n- GDPR complaince\n- fault tolerance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7XdbHszd1CeJfBz-pjW0A",
